# Everything under tests/ is scratch unless it is named here.
#
# Agents and probes write throwaway copies of the app, the scripts that drive
# them, and whole directories of comparison screenshots straight into tests/ so
# the static server can reach them. They follow no naming convention: pattern
# rules chased _*.mjs, then _*.html, then *.png, and each time something arrived
# in a shape the rules did not cover -- most recently anshots/, aoshots/ and
# gzshots/, which a `git add -A` swept into a commit. Allowlisting is the only
# rule that does not lose that race.
tests/*
!tests/build-local.mjs
!tests/package.json
!tests/profile.mjs
!tests/test.mjs
